**Confirmed direct callers (`find_symbol_references` and grep agree, 5 matches):**

1. `OrderSetResource1_12.save` returns the result of `saveOrderSet` after resolving member concepts and order types by UUID. Its return value is what the REST layer hands back to the client. @file:{openmrs-module-webservices.rest::omod/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/v1_0/resource/openmrs1_12/OrderSetResource1_12.java:57-72}
2. `OrderSetMemberResource1_12.save` adds a member to its parent and saves the parent. It returns the delegate, so it depends on the parent being persisted with the new member. @file:{openmrs-module-webservices.rest::omod/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/v1_0/resource/openmrs1_12/OrderSetMemberResource1_12.java:162-168}
