4. `OrderSetMemberResource1_12.purge` removes a member, then saves the parent. It relies on `saveOrderSet` persisting the removal. @file:{openmrs-module-webservices.rest::omod/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/v1_0/resource/openmrs1_12/OrderSetMemberResource1_12.java:170-175}
5. `OrderSetMemberController1_12Test` saves an order set with an added member, then checks that the member is visible through the REST endpoint. @file:{openmrs-module-webservices.rest::omod/src/test/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/v1_0/controller/openmrs1_12/OrderSetMemberController1_12Test.java:82-97}

